Original commit body from 3173eed:

Symbols may have absolute paths (e.g., /home/user/repo/src/file.py)
which would incorrectly appear as "/" in the structure tree.

- Add to_relative() helper that uses Path.relative_to() for robust conversion
- apply to_relative() in add_file() to catch all path sources
- Skip paths outside repo_root instead of including invalid paths
- Simplify code by removing duplicated path conversion logic
